  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Fragrance Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean at Sephora</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Gluten Free</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><b>What it is: </b>A hybrid luminizer that enhances bare skin and makeup with a shimmery, naturally radiant finish, made with rhode’s signature Glazing Milk formula.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Coverage: </strong>Light</p><p><strong> </strong></p><p><strong>Finish: </strong>Radiant</p><p><strong> </strong></p><p><strong>Formulation: </strong>Liquid</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><p><strong>Suggested Usage:</strong></p><p>-Shake before use.</p><p>-Apply two to four shakes into hands and gently press all over—on your face, neck, décolleté, and body.</p><p><br></p><p>rhode Tricks:</p><p>-For an all-over glow, apply to your décolleté, chest, legs, or anywhere you want a soft shimmer.</p><p>-Mix with foundation or tinted moisturizer to sheer out coverage, blend effortlessly, and add a natural, pearly finish.</p><p>-Combine with your face or body moisturizer for a soft, luminous finish.</p></div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\"><p style=\"margin:0in;\">-Ceramide Trio (NP, AP, EOP): Moisturizes, smooths, and reinforces skin’s natural barrier.</p><p style=\"margin:0in;\">-Mineral Complex (Magnesium, Zinc, and Copper): Defends against free radicals for smooth skin.</p><p style=\"margin:0in;\">-Vitamin E: An antioxidant that protects against external stressors.</p><p style=\"margin:0in;\"><br></p><p>Water/Aqua/Eau, Coconut Alkanes, Glycerin, C12-15 Alkyl Benzoate, Polyglyceryl-10 Mono/Dioleate, Polyglyceryl-3 Oleate, Mica, Diisopropyl Dimer Dilinoleate, Phenoxyethanol, Silica, Tocopheryl Acetate, Ceramide NP, Ceramide AP, Ceramide EOP, Copper Gluconate, Magnesium Aspartate, Zinc Gluconate, Oleic Acid, Linoleic Acid, Linolenic Acid, Capryloyl Glycerin/Sebacic Acid Copolymer, Xanthan Gum, Euterpe Oleracea Sterols, Phosphatidylglycerol, Phytosphingosine, Caprylyl Glycol, Cholesterol, Coco-Caprylate/Caprate, PEG-7 Glyceryl Cocoate, Cetyl Hydroxyethylcellulose, Carbomer, Sodium Lauroyl Lactylate, Tin Oxide, Pentylene Glycol, Sodium Citrate, Sodium Phytate, Ethylhexylglycerin, Chlorphenesin, Citric Acid, Sodium Hydroxide, Titanium Dioxide (CI 77891), Iron Oxides (CI 77491, CI 77492, CI 77499).</p><p><br></p><p><em>The list of ingredients is subject to change. Please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</em></p></div></details>",
  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Fragrance Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean at Sephora</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Gluten Free</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><b>What it is: </b>A hybrid luminizer that enhances bare skin and makeup with a shimmery, naturally radiant finish, made with rhode’s signature Glazing Milk formula.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Coverage: </strong>Light</p><p><strong> </strong></p><p><strong>Finish: </strong>Radiant</p><p><strong> </strong></p><p><strong>Formulation: </strong>Liquid</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><p><strong>Suggested Usage:</strong></p><p>-Shake before use.</p><p>-Apply two to four shakes into hands and gently press all over—on your face, neck, décolleté, and body.</p><p><br></p><p>rhode Tricks:</p><p>-For an all-over glow, apply to your décolleté